{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rogue Snake is the latest evolution of the classical snake game. We've added combat and roguelite mechanics - earn levels, upgrade your Mecha Snake and defeat bosses while dodging enemy attacks! <br><br>Everybody has at least once played a snake game on their phone. We took that classical formula and upgraded it a lot. Now you need to kill enemies and bosses by collecting powers. Every level gives a choice of multiple upgrades which will help you in combat and survival. Dont forget to not bite your own tail aswell!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3207150?t=1746794585","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3207150/91dba689258151f43e41d3ca68b6e81c8febd386/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1746794585","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3207150/3b19b21ee28e69ccdfa2df12ad41180bc9dea50c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746794585","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3207150/3b19b21ee28e69ccdfa2df12ad41180bc9dea50c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746794585","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Rogue Snake is the latest evolution of the classical snake game. We've added combat and roguelite mechanics - earn levels, upgrade your Mecha Snake and defeat bosses while dodging enemy attacks! <br><br>Everybody has at least once played a snake game on their phone. We took that classical formula and upgraded it a lot. Now you need to kill enemies and bosses by collecting powers. Every level gives a choice of multiple upgrades which will help you in combat and survival. Dont forget to not bite your own tail aswell!</p>","developers":[" Natrix"],"genres